<title>USA: Moody's raises Wisconsin clean water bonds to Aa2.</title>
<headline>Moody's raises Wisconsin clean water bonds to Aa2.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, Jan 22 - Moody's Investors Service - Rating Announcement As of 12/16/96.</p>
<p>    Issuer		: Wisconsin, State of Clean water rev.</p>
<p>    State		 : WI</p>
<p>    Rating		: Aa2</p>
<p>    Sale Amount	 : 75,000,000</p>
<p>Expected Sale Date: 01/24/97</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
